### User Register

POST {{vsa_w_controller_csharp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vsac/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "username": "example1234",
    "password": "example1234"
}

### User Login
POST {{vsa_w_controller_csharp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vsac/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "example1234",
    "password": "example1234"
}

### User Login - Proxy

POST {{proxy}}/api/v1/vsac/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "example123",
    "password": "example123"
}


### User Refresh Token
POST {{vsa_w_controller_csharp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vsac/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{refresh_token}}


### Create a blog

POST {{vsa_w_controller_csharp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vsac/blog/new-blog
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{access_token}}
Accept: application/json

{
    "Title": "Example5",
    "Description": "Testing5",
    "Content": "Testing5",
    "StorageKey": [
        
    ]
}
        # "path/2026/06/996a711d-b24e-44e7-b4f1-95dba90bb255.png"


